## File Structure

```
finance-dashboard/
├── index.html   — markup, structure, modal
├── style.css    — all styling, CSS variables, responsive breakpoints
├── app.js       — state, data, render logic, charts
└── README.md    — this file
```

---

## Technical Notes

- **No frameworks.** Pure HTML/CSS/JS — zero build tooling, zero npm dependencies.
- **Chart.js 4.4** loaded via CDN for charts.
- **Fonts** from Google Fonts: DM Serif Display, Instrument Sans, DM Mono.
- All chart instances stored on `state.charts` and `.destroy()`-ed before re-render to avoid memory leaks.
- HTML is escaped via `escHtml()` before insertion to prevent XSS.
- All monetary values formatted with `en-IN` locale and `₹` symbol.
